  _key: DIALOGUE_NODE_SIR_ALDRIC_IMPRISONED_RETURN
  _displayName: Imprisoned Return
  _description: Aldric asks the Player to find a way to release him from captivity.
  _speakerName: Sir Aldric
  _dialogueText: 'The chains still hold, and my strength fades with every passing
    day.

    If you find a way to open these cells, perhaps my oath need not end
    here.'
